{
  "id": 8867158130887,
  "title": "Christmas Bedding Quilt – Soft Microfiber Holiday Bedsprea - Design 02",
  "handle": "christmas-bedding-quilt-soft-microfiber-holiday-bedsprea-design-02",
  "body_html": "<p>Embrace the holiday spirit with the Jeminise Christmas Quilt, designed to bring warmth and festive cheer to your home. Crafted from premium microfiber, this quilt offers exceptional softness and breathability, ensuring cozy comfort throughout the year. Its vibrant Christmas prints make it a delightful addition to any bedroom or living area, and it serves as a thoughtful gift for family and friends during the holiday season.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Festive Holiday Design:</strong> Features bright, high-quality Christmas prints that create a warm, joyful atmosphere and add a festive touch to your home decor.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Premium Comfort:</strong> Made from soft, lightweight microfiber, providing warmth in winter and coolness in warmer months for year-round versatility.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Offered in Throw (60\"x70\"), Twin (68\"x86\"), Full (80\"x90\"), Queen (90\"x90\"), and King (102\"x91\") to perfectly fit various beds, sofas, or as a decorative seasonal quilt.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Thoughtful Gift:</strong> A cozy and meaningful present for loved ones during Christmas, New Year, birthdays, or other holiday celebrations.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable with cold water on a gentle cycle, and tumble dry low or air dry for long-lasting softness, fade-resistance, and wrinkle-free use.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Sets</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Microfiber</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>Quilt</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Christmas</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Design</th>\n<td>Christmas Quilt-DS02</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Throw (60\"x70\"), Twin (68\"x86\"), Full (80\"x90\"), Queen (90\"x90\"), King (102\"x91\")</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Special Feature</th>\n<td>Lightweight, Wrinkle-Free, Fade-Resistant</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine wash cold, gentle cycle. Tumble dry low or air dry.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
